      314.64,
      562.13,
      336.71
    ],
    "text": "Seylan Business (Pvt) Ltd of No. 10/18 Lake Drive, Colombo08; Extent: 3.2657 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      354.24,
      562.23,
      472.31
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land on which aservitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorised in writing, beforeme at Divisional Secretariat, Mannar Town on the 15.02.2019at 10.00 a.m. and further you are hereby requested to notifyto me in. writing [in duplicate] on or before the 08.02.2019, thenature of their interests in the land, the particulars of theirclaims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of thecomputation of such amount.",
